#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:80
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:216
msgid "Power Management"
msgstr "电源管理"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:82
msgid "Open the |sticks3_power_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |sticks3_power_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:84
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:218
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates power management features including battery "
"voltage monitoring, VBUS voltage reading, charging status detection, and "
"control of battery charging and external output. Press BtnA to toggle "
"external output (5V OUT), and press BtnB to toggle battery charging."
msgstr ""
"此示例演示了电源管理功能，包括电池电压监控、VBUS 电压读取、充电状态检测以及电池充电和外部输出的控制。按 BtnA 切换外部输出（5V "
"OUT），按 BtnB 切换电池充电。"

