#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:95
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:231
msgid "IR Transmission"
msgstr "红外发射"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:97
msgid "Open the |sticks3_ir_tx_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |sticks3_ir_tx_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:99
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:233
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates infrared (IR) transmission functionality. When "
"button A is pressed, it sends IR data with a specified address and data "
"value. The example displays the address and data being transmitted."
msgstr "此示例演示了红外（IR）发射功能。当按下按键 A 时，它会发送带有指定地址和数据值的 IR 数据。示例会显示正在传输的地址和数据。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:102
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:236
msgid "When using IR transmission, the external output mode should be enabled."
msgstr "使用红外发送时，需要启用外部输出模式。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:106
msgid "|sticks3_ir_tx_example.png|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/refs/controllers.sticks3.ref:7
msgid "sticks3_ir_tx_example.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:113
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:249
msgid "IR Reception"
msgstr "红外接收"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:115
msgid "Open the |sticks3_ir_rx_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |sticks3_ir_rx_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:117
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates infrared (IR) reception functionality using NEC"
" decode protocol. When IR data is received, it displays the address and "
"data values on the screen."
msgstr "此示例演示了使用 NEC 解码协议的红外（IR）接收功能。当接收到 IR 数据时，它会在屏幕上显示地址和数据值。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:120
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:254
msgid ""
"When using IR reception, the PA (Power Amplifier) should be turned off "
"and the external output mode should be enabled."
msgstr "使用红外接收时，需要关闭 PA（功率放大器）并启用外部输出模式。"

