#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:131
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:267
msgid "Audio Recording and Playback"
msgstr "音频录制与播放"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:133
msgid "Open the |sticks3_audio_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |sticks3_audio_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:135
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:269
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates audio recording and playback functionality. "
"Press button A to start recording for 5 seconds. After recording "
"completes, the audio will automatically play back. The example displays "
"the recording status and countdown timer."
msgstr "此示例演示了音频录制和播放功能。按下按键 A 开始录制 5 秒。录制完成后，音频将自动播放。示例会显示录制状态和倒计时器。"

