msgstr ""

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:161
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:298
msgid "RTC Clock"
msgstr "RTC 时钟"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:163
msgid "Open the |sticks3_rtc_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |sticks3_rtc_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:166
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:303
msgid ""
"This example supports StickS3 Lite and StickS3 v1.1 or later. Earlier "
"StickS3 hardware versions do not include the RTC used by this example."
msgstr "注意：此示例支持 StickS3 Lite，以及 v1.1 或更高硬件版本的 StickS3。更早版本的 StickS3 硬件不包含此示例使用的 RTC。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:169
msgid ""
"This example reads the built-in RTC and displays the current time. Press "
"**BtnA** to select the hour, minute, or second field. Press **BtnB** to "
"increment the selected field. Press **BtnA** again after the seconds "
"field to write the new time to the RTC."
msgstr "此示例读取内置 RTC 并显示当前时间。按下 **BtnA** 选择小时、分钟或秒字段，按下 **BtnB** 增加所选字段的值。设置完秒后再次按下 **BtnA**，将新时间写入 RTC。"

